---
// The differentiator: autonomy + partner linking (PYNAPLI_PRODUCT_SPEC).
---

<section class="diff">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Why Pynapli</p>
    <blockquote>Every adult has <em>their&nbsp;own&nbsp;voice.</em></blockquote>
    <p class="dsub">
      Other apps make couples share one account and one card. Pynapli doesn’t. Every person keeps
      their own profile, chats, media, and controls. Linking a partner adds a visible, honest
      connection — it never merges you into one identity. It’s how real lifestyle spaces already
      work.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .diff {
    padding: clamp(72px, 11vw, 150px) 0;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .diff .container {
    max-width: 860px;
  }
  blockquote {
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 6vw, 4.4rem);
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  blockquote em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .dsub {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 28px auto 0;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
</style>
